  message: "Precise 3-budget quantification (blind-severity-derived priority signal: P1). Across the three derived JSON budget sketches the nodes_summary overstates serialization: 4k claims included 19 nodes/27 edges but serializes 1 node/0 edges; 16k claims 43/115 but serializes 12/10; 64k claims 139/467 but serializes 75/191. The 4k case is ~19x off on nodes and loses all edges. included.count describes the inclusion computation; a later serialization step shrinks the arrays further without reconciling the summary."  # ebdb
